<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-News Ltd abandons HWT top editor job.</title>
<headline>RTRS-News Ltd abandons HWT top editor job.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>News Ltd, the Australian operating arm of News Corp Ltd, said on Monday it had appointed Herald and Weekly Times (HWT) editor-in-chief Steve Harris to an executive position in the Sydney head office.</p>
<p>The company said the Melbourne-based HWT position would not be filled. Harris would become group senior executive, office of the managing director, which News Ltd said was a new position.</p>
<p>Harris will report to managing director Lachlan Murdoch and be responsible for a wide-range of group and corporate functions.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
